<final>


The contract validates asset transfer parameters but fails to prevent account takeover through rekeying.

### Vulnerability: Unchecked Rekey To
### Explanation: The contract does not validate the rekey_to field, allowing an attacker to set it to their own address while the transaction passes all other checks, resulting in permanent account control transfer.
### Risk: Critical - Complete account takeover and loss of all assets
